{title: We Believe}
{artist: Newsboys}
{key: D}

{comment: Intro}
[D]  [G] x2

[D]In this time of [G]desperation   [D]
When all we know is doubt and [G]fear
[Bm]  There is only One [G]Salvation
We [D]believe, We [G]believe

[D]In this broken [G]generation   [D]
When all is dark, You help us [G]see
[Bm]  There is only One [G]Foundation
We [D]believe, We [G]believe

{comment: Chorus}
We [D]believe in God the Father, We [A]believe in Jesus Christ
We [Bm]believe in the Holy Spirit, And He's [G]given us new life
We [D]believe in the crucifixion, We [A]believe that He conquered death
We [Bm]believe in the resurrection, And He's [G]comin' back again
We [D]believe     [G]

[D]So, let our faith be more than [G]anthems   [D]
Greater than the songs we [G]sing   [Bm]
And in our weakness and [G]temptations
We [D]believe, We [G]believe!

{comment: Tag}
Let the [G]lost be found and the [A]dead be raised!
In the [Bm]here and now, let [F#m]love invade!
Let the [G]church live loud, our [A]God will say
We [Bm]believe, We [F#m]believe!

And the [G]gates of hell will [A]not prevail!
For the [Bm]power of God, has [F#m]torn the veil!
Now we [G]know Your love will [A]never fail!
We [Bm]believe, We [F#m]believe!

Chorus (Last):
We [D]believe in God the Father, We [A]believe in Jesus Christ
We [Bm]believe in the Holy Spirit, And He's [G]given us new life
We [D]believe in the crucifixion, We [A]believe that He conquered death
We [Bm]believe in the resurrection, And He's [G]comin' back again
He's comin' back [D]again!   [A]
